Periodic Horizon Review: Risk is time-bound and context-dependent. A capability that is catastrophic today may become harmless tomorrow because defensive technologies (vaccines, patch protocols, containment fields) have matured. Vaulted capabilities must undergo scheduled reviews to determine if the threat horizon has shifted.
