We began this conversation examining two hypothetical systems: one that quickly gives a plausible answer, and one that pauses to test its assumptions and question the problem itself.
Our journey has shown that the true mark of intelligence—and the ultimate goal of AI engineering—is not the creation of an infallible oracle, an unchallengeable optimizer, or an omniscient machine sovereign.
